===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*weǵʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|weight}}, {{m|enm|weiȝte}}, {{m|enm|weght}}, {{m|enm|wight}}, from {{inh|en|ang|wiht}}, {{m|ang|ġewiht||weight}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*wihtiz}} {{gloss|"weight"; compare {{m|gem-pro|*weganą||to move}}}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*weǵʰ-||to move; pull; draw; drive}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|weigh|t|id2=th|pos2=abstract nominal suffix}}.

Cognate with {{cog|sco|wecht}}, {{m|sco|weicht||weight}}, {{cog|stq|Wächte||scale}}, {{m|stq|Gewicht||weight}}, {{cog|fy|gewicht||weight}}, {{cog|nl|gewicht||weight}}, {{cog|nds-de|Wicht}}, {{m|nds-de|Gewicht||weight}}, {{cog|de|Wucht|t=massiveness, force}}, {{m|de|Gewicht||weight}}.

